# SHA-256 of lower-cased identifying tokens taken from the original real bills (customer name, bill and ticket
# references, till/receipt ids, card suffixes). One-way hashes: this file lets CI refuse the real values without
# containing them. NOT a secrecy mechanism: a short value (a 4-digit card suffix) can be brute-forced from its hash.
# It exists only to stop the real values being committed again. If a collision with an innocent word ever
# appears, change the synthetic data, not this list.
